{"name":"Nethjet","status":"ok","title":"Nethjet","pageId":110630,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-frwiki pi-layout-default type-location\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Nethjet</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Geography<sup id=\"cite_ref-WoW-c3_1-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-WoW-c3-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Type</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">City</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"region\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Thay</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>Nethjet</b> was a city located in Thay.<sup id=\"cite_ref-WoW-c3_1-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-WoW-c3-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\"><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Inhabitants\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Inhabitants</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#History\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">History</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Appendix\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Appendix</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Appearances\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Appearances</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-3\"><a href=\"#Novels_&_Short_Stories\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Novels &amp; Short Stories</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-3\"><a href=\"#Organized_Play_&_Licensed_Adventures\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.1.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Organized Play &amp; Licensed Adventures</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#References\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">References</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Inhabitants\">Inhabitants</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Inhabitants\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Nethjet?veaction=edit&section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Inhabitants\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Marek_Rym%C3%BCt\" title=\"Marek Rymüt\">Marek Rymüt</a> was native to this city and received training in magic to be a <a href=\"/wiki/Red_Wizard\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Red Wizard\">Red Wizard</a> at a magic school located there in the early 14<sup>th</sup> century <a href=\"/wiki/DR\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"DR\">DR</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-WoW-c3_1-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-WoW-c3-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"History\">History</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: History\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Nethjet?veaction=edit&section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section: History\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Nethjet fell into ruin during the events of the <a href=\"/wiki/Spellplague\" title=\"Spellplague\">Spellplague</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/1385_DR\" title=\"1385 DR\">Year of Blue Fire, 1385 DR</a>, when the upheaval of the <a href=\"/wiki/Thayan_Plateau\" title=\"Thayan Plateau\">Thayan Plateau</a> and eruption of the <a href=\"/wiki/Thaymount\" title=\"Thaymount\">Thaymount</a> caused the entire region to become broken and transformed into the <a href=\"/wiki/Bonedark_Hills\" title=\"Bonedark Hills\">Bonedark Hills</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-FRCG-p183_2-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCG-p183-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>In the late 15<sup>th</sup> century <a href=\"/wiki/DR\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"DR\">DR</a>, Thayan forces began rebuilding and reinforcing Nethjet into a ringed fortress known as a <a href=\"/wiki/Dread_Ring\" title=\"Dread Ring\">Dread Ring</a>,<sup id=\"cite_ref-FRCG-p180_3-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCG-p180-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite_ref-FRCG-p182_4-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCG-p182-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> and patrols of Thayan troops (including <a href=\"/wiki/Undead\" title=\"Undead\">undead</a> increased around the city.<sup id=\"cite_ref-FRCG-p183_2-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCG-p183-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appendix\">Appendix</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Appendix\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Nethjet?veaction=edit&section=3\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Appendix\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"metadata plainlinks stub\"><tbody><tr>\n<td><i>This article is incomplete.</i>  <i>You can help the Forgotten Realms Wiki by providing more information.</i></td>\n</tr></tbody></table>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appearances\">Appearances</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Appearances\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Nethjet?veaction=edit&section=4\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Appearances\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<div class=\"block-indent\"><h4><span id=\"Novels_.26_Short_Stories\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Novels_&_Short_Stories\">Novels &amp; Short Stories</span></h4><div class=\"block-indent\"><i><a href=\"/wiki/Whisper_of_Waves\" title=\"Whisper of Waves\">Whisper of Waves</a></i></div><h4><span id=\"Organized_Play_.26_Licensed_Adventures\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Organized_Play_&_Licensed_Adventures\">Organized Play &amp; Licensed Adventures</span></h4><div class=\"block-indent\"></div><div class=\"block-indent\"><b><small>Referenced only</small></b><br><small><i><span class=\"new\" title=\"The Undumor Connection (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvVGhlX1VuZHVtb3JfQ29ubmV